A||||7||88FORMULA-T-TOP-GUY||Last ? for the day.  Who sells a good Formula bra?||||1||
Z||000000||88FORMULA-T-TOP-GUY||05-02-2001||02:15 PM||||Has anyone purchased a bra for a Formula or similar body style that they are pleased with and that was a good price? Please point me in the right direction.  Thanks.||||reg||1
Z||000001||rogergarrison||05-02-2001||02:52 PM||||My opinion.........dont !!!!!!<P>(unless your paint is already messed up)||||reg||1
Z||000002||Haze_Performance||05-03-2001||01:38 AM||||Well.... I put a bra on my '85 (Silver Coupe) The paint was perfect before I put it on. I put it on last spring to protect the nose from all the expressway driving I do. I got lazy and left it on all winter. (Chicago had a crappy winter last year) I pulled it off a few weeks ago & the front end was fine. The bra didnt do any damage to the paint at all. Maybe I got lucky..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> It was a LeBra. Ive used many brands of front end covers over the years.. LeBra is the best... <P>My 2 1/2 cents  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><I>Haze</I><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">    </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><P><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||14
Z||000003||rogergarrison||05-03-2001||10:22 AM||||hi haze<P>Id say you were just lucky, and im sure lots of other are too. Im just speaking from my experience. I get them here all the time to get paint fixed. Lisas hood corners were worn clear thru to the fiber strands and their still trying to come thru the new paint....again. A girl in my car club just bought a used Viper, had to paint the hood and both front fenders on it from a bra (has 4000 total miles). I dont know what brands, I just dont take the chance.||||reg||1
Z||000004||KissMySSFiero||05-03-2001||07:35 PM||||heres a pic of mine with a bra...i got it to cover some front end damage.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-001f_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||firstfiero||05-04-2001||10:53 AM||||    I have one because of front end damage..don't buy a wolf bra!!! piece of s***! I got a calgon bra and couldn't be happier. lebra are hit and miss with fit but it looks like the fiero one looks pretty good. I had one on my storm gsi for 3 years and never saw any damage to the paint..<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">     <BR>Todd <BR>  86se<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/photo3.jpg"> ||||reg||14
